  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hello Devs,\n\nVRChat no longer launches in VR mode on SteamVR beta version 1.27.5, which was the easiest / lightest version for streaming. It now only launches in desktop mode on that version.\n\nIf you could fix this it would be much appreciated please, because the current version of steam's VR overlay uses between 1-2gb of extra VRAM compared to 1.27.5. \n\nThank you",
